{"segment_id": "segment_00012", "start": 360.0, "end": 390.0, "speech": "句话，您先写摘要写作，就在我们文章的下方啊。您找到摘要写作那几个汉字，写完来这儿对一下答案就可以了。有什么不懂的，您留言告诉我，我就给您回答了，好吧？然后呢，topic for discussion，这就是话题了。话题呢，我们只是每次给大家说一下这个话题啊，因为各位现在的水平，直接去做这个题稍微还是有一些难的。我们看一下题吧。说 Have you ever been out to the sea in a small boat? Tell us about it。", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000027.webp", "time": 366.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "The girl set out from the coast one afternoon", "and was caught in a storm. Her boat struck a", "rock, so she jumped into the sea. She swam", "eight miles that night. She reached the shore", "early next morning. She had seen a light high", "up on the cliffs and she climbed up. She found", "herself in hospital a day later."], "scores": [0.99681, 0.98352, 0.95479, 0.98063, 0.98078, 0.98388, 0.95975, 0.98066], "boxes": [[[53.0, 129.0], [568.0, 134.0], [567.0, 204.0], [52.0, 198.0]], [[107.0, 330.0], [1135.0, 330.0], [1135.0, 398.0], [107.0, 398.0]], [[103.0, 389.0], [1124.0, 392.0], [1124.0, 461.0], [103.0, 458.0]], [[104.0, 455.0], [1107.0, 457.0], [1107.0, 518.0], [104.0, 516.0]], [[106.0, 519.0], [1134.0, 515.0], [1134.0, 577.0], [106.0, 581.0]], [[103.0, 577.0], [1144.0, 575.0], [1144.0, 643.0], [103.0, 645.0]], [[102.0, 635.0], [1174.0, 632.0], [1174.0, 705.0], [102.0, 708.0]], [[105.0, 699.0], [780.0, 703.0], [780.0, 762.0], [105.0, 758.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000028.webp", "time": 373.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "训练目标：", "完全自由的对话", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.99824, 0.98238, 0.99958, 0.99892, 0.99953], "boxes": [[[57.0, 137.0], [560.0, 137.0], [560.0, 197.0], [57.0, 197.0]], [[108.0, 333.0], [343.0, 333.0], [343.0, 394.0], [108.0, 394.0]], [[107.0, 397.0], [469.0, 397.0], [469.0, 460.0], [107.0, 460.0]], [[322.0, 603.0], [539.0, 614.0], [536.0, 669.0], [319.0, 657.0]], [[335.0, 687.0], [524.0, 698.0], [521.0, 756.0], [332.0, 745.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000029.webp", "time": 377.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for dis